# A NEGATIVE FIXTURE of the runner's refusals (scripts/formal/check_idris.py,
# `_idris_refusals`; [STYL.5.10.5]): an input the
# lowering never writes, fed to Fixture.idr on every run, which must exit 2
# with exactly the line in callsite_unanswered.expected. The call site names
# response kind 0 and no `answer` record declares one: run, the site would
# sweep a kind the model knows nothing of and record a call on it, a wrong
# answer the engine comparison would report as libds's.
schema 0 explicit Reply
schema 1 explicit Trig
alpha 0 0
alpha 1 1
rule 0 r
pattern 0 1 0
callsite 0 0 0 svc.read none 0 0 0 lit s:0
step assert _0 1 1 1
step pump
